{"presentation":{"slides":[{"elements":[{"x":53.37690631808279,"y":21.517685385618442,"width":38.12636165577342,"height":54.87009773332702,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>Die&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>Bestandteile&nbsp;<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:3em;\"><strong>des&nbsp;Atlasses<\/strong><\/span><\/p>"},"subContentId":"c4dbefd1-5b89-4fdb-be3e-37e6983f8114","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":0,"y":0,"width":52.189542483660134,"height":100,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":false,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-68d0e3ddedcd6.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":400,"height":388},"alt":"Atlasf\u00fchrerschein"},"subContentId":"c8f1d754-5084-445a-86a6-5c657cbc58c8","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"PD","title":"Atlas in der Hand halten","authors":[{"name":"Digitalassistenz","role":"Author"}],"licenseExtras":"erstellt mit der emu KI Dall-e","yearTo":2025}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{"fillSlideBackground":"#b9e9d7"}},{"slideBackgroundSelector":{},"elements":[{"x":3.2679738562091507,"y":10.70160564968347,"width":43.57298474945534,"height":89.29839435031653,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><span style=\"font-size:1em;\"><strong>Diese Inhalte findest du in einem Atlas:<\/strong><\/span><\/p><ol><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Karten\u00fcbersicht Weltkarte (Bilderrahmen)<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Kartenverzeichnis<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Karten lesen: Methodischer Teil<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Kartenmaterial<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Register<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Sachwortregister<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Quellenverzeichnis<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">Rekorde der Erde<\/span><\/li><li><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">L\u00e4nderregister<\/span><\/li><\/ol>"},"subContentId":"dc432c8f-cc12-40a5-bdfd-cd949d4663f8","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":50.12105323945442,"y":19.370751886496002,"width":45.1649527445635,"height":64.56917295498667,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":true,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-67e5589b432f0.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":391,"height":283}},"subContentId":"4802c619-ff91-4046-b633-2a3a9bcddb0f","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"PD","title":"Karte mit Lupe","authors":[{"name":"Digitalassistenz","role":"Author"}],"licenseExtras":"erstellt mit emuKI DALL\u00b7E 3","yearFrom":2025}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""}]},{"elements":[{"x":4.357322207637297,"y":11.189364938985685,"width":45.76037995849651,"height":75.31303324317288,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><strong>1. Karten\u00fcbersicht Weltkarte (Bilderrahmen):<\/strong><br>Am Anfang des Atlas gibt es eine Weltkarte mit bunten \"Bilderrahmen\" und Seitenzahlen. Diese \u00dcbersicht zeigt dir schnell, welche Karten im Atlas enthalten sind und wo du sie finden kannst, z.B. f\u00fcr Regionen wie Europa oder Afrika.<br>&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>2. Kartenverzeichnis:<\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Das Kartenverzeichnis ist eine Liste oder ein Inhaltsverzeichnis, das alle Karten im Atlas auflistet.<\/p>"},"subContentId":"12570726-154b-4f12-b85f-38c13b2cceb0","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":54.46652759546621,"y":11.834905223927166,"width":42.54042449149342,"height":42.51923085201176,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":true,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-68d0e47bad299.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":500,"height":253}},"subContentId":"668b390b-2bb7-4832-84a8-4077f0e15373","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"PD","title":"Karten\u00fcbersicht","authors":[{"name":"Digitalassistenz","role":"Author"}],"source":"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File:Physical_Map_of_the_World_(2021).svg"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{}},{"elements":[{"x":5.985172884946032,"y":12.910089578965946,"width":42.493936442146136,"height":45.198421068490674,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><strong>3. Methodenteil:<\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Der Methodenteil hilft dir zu verstehen, wie du die Karten richtig lesen kannst.&nbsp;<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>4. Kartenmaterial:<\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Hier findest du viele verschiedene Karten, die unterschiedliche Informationen darstellen.<\/p>"},"subContentId":"f9268d8a-e19d-4625-ad39-c686b505f2e6","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":37.03703703703704,"y":59.85157068682447,"width":45.751633986928105,"height":40.062358386428336,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":false,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-67e55a60e93df.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":512,"height":227}},"subContentId":"e6441076-3f3c-4796-b17e-a015a88e182a","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"CC BY-SA","title":"Thematische Karte zum Thema Entwicklungsl\u00e4nder","authors":[{"name":"Cflm001","role":"Author"}],"licenseVersion":"3.0","yearFrom":2009,"source":"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File:UN_Human_Development_Report_2008.svg"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":82.6797385620915,"y":59.81929408929428,"width":17.275219840059005,"height":40.18070591070572,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":false,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-68d0e53ab5f82.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":400,"height":471}},"subContentId":"0600ad34-7fd5-4ae2-9fd9-36fdb8f9fc72","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"CC BY-SA","title":"Sachsen-Anhalt, Verwaltungsgliederungen","authors":[{"name":"WANNEN","role":"Author"}],"licenseVersion":"3.0","yearFrom":2012,"source":"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File:Saxony-Anhalt,_administrative_divisions_-_de_-_colored.svg"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":0,"y":59.81929408929428,"width":38.12636165577342,"height":40.022980937441496,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":false,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-68d0e4c35beec.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":800,"height":434}},"subContentId":"cacddc12-1ad5-44ac-843e-e773223a1ff5","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"PD","title":"Weltkarte","authors":[{"name":"Central Intelligence Agency (CIA)","role":"Author"}],"source":"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/File:Weltkarte.jpg","yearFrom":2001}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":64.16156950745919,"y":6.455402849414818,"width":23.20927059500011,"height":40,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":true,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-68d0e595a2275.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":400,"height":349}},"subContentId":"b0a6a71c-c12f-4d2e-812d-d433c7fba29a","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"CC BY-SA","title":"Karte suchen - Karte Lesen","authors":[{"name":"Digitalassistenz","role":"Author"}],"licenseVersion":"4.0"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{}},{"elements":[{"x":4.357298474945534,"y":10.758842692809221,"width":68.62745098039215,"height":81.76720446535008,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><strong>5. Register:<\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Das Register ist ein Verzeichnis aller in den Karten enthaltenden Namen am Ende eines Buches. Das hei\u00dft, hier findest du alle Namen, die im Atlas vorkommen, z.B. von L\u00e4ndern, St\u00e4dten oder Fl\u00fcssen. Sie sind alphabetisch sortiert.<br>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>6. Sachwortregister:<\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Das Sachwortregister enth\u00e4lt Themen oder Begriffe, die im Atlas erkl\u00e4rt werden. Das k\u00f6nnen Dinge wie \"Vulkane\", \"Klimazonen\" oder \"W\u00fcsten\" sein. Wenn du mehr \u00fcber ein bestimmtes Thema erfahren m\u00f6chtest, suchst du im Sachwortregister nach dem Begriff und findest die Seitenzahl, auf der das Thema genauer erkl\u00e4rt wird.<br>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>Zusammengefasst:<\/strong> Ein Register kann eine breite Palette von Eintr\u00e4gen enthalten, w\u00e4hrend ein Sachwortregister speziell auf inhaltliche Begriffe fokussiert ist.<\/p><p><br>&nbsp;<\/p>"},"metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"},"subContentId":"e56fbcd0-495e-4a47-a01e-e9754f9bfd64"},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":77.34204793028321,"y":13.196387610977462,"width":19.607843137254903,"height":72.29942289567796,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":true,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-6878b9603f58e.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":600,"height":1120}},"subContentId":"cc172c6a-1d61-4de1-85d3-e30b31482812","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"CC BY-SA","title":"Register Globus","authors":[{"name":"Digitalassistenz","role":"Author"}],"licenseVersion":"4.0"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{}},{"elements":[{"x":3.2679738562091507,"y":10.75884269280922,"width":71.89542483660131,"height":79.61543592678824,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><strong>7. Quellenverzeichnis:<\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Das Quellenverzeichnis ist eine Liste von Quellen, die f\u00fcr die Erstellung des Buches verwendet wurden. Es zeigt dir genau, woher die Informationen, die im Atlas stehen, stammen.<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>8. Rekorde der Erde:<\/strong><br>Ein spannender Teil des Atlas: Hier findest du Informationen \u00fcber au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnliche oder rekordverd\u00e4chtige Merkmale der Erde, wie der h\u00f6chste Berg oder der l\u00e4ngste Fluss.<\/p><p>&nbsp;<\/p><p><strong>9. L\u00e4nderregister:<\/strong>&nbsp;<br>Das L\u00e4nderregister ist ein Verzeichnis aller L\u00e4nder, die im Buch behandelt werden, oft mit zus\u00e4tzlichen Informationen wie Hauptst\u00e4dten oder geographischen Besonderheiten.<\/p>"},"metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"},"subContentId":"46986d69-e5fb-4294-b929-407e5ecd000c"},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":74.07407407407408,"y":30.124759539865817,"width":24.501061390616865,"height":40,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":true,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","file":{"path":"images\/file-6878bc5b2a60f.png","mime":"image\/png","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":634,"height":524}},"subContentId":"e0fa9900-984c-4833-a911-186d4b3def56","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"CC0 1.0","title":"Mountain nature","authors":[{"name":"Digitalassistenz","role":"Author"}],"source":"https:\/\/publicdomainvectors.org\/en\/free-clipart\/Mountain-nature\/83118.html"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""}],"slideBackgroundSelector":{}},{"slideBackgroundSelector":{},"elements":[{"x":53.37690631808279,"y":15.062379769932909,"width":43.57298474945534,"height":69.87201280732634,"action":{"library":"H5P.AdvancedText 1.1","params":{"text":"<p><span style=\"font-size:1em;color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\"><strong>Was bedeuten die verschiedene Farben am Blattrand in einem Atlas?<\/strong><\/span><br><br>Dir ist bestimmt schon aufgefallen, dass im Atlas <span style=\"font-size:1em;color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\">unterschiedliche Farben am Blattrand verwendet werden. Diese Farben sind daf\u00fcr da, um verschiedene Abschnitte oder Themen in einem Buch zu kennzeichnen.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1em;color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\">Sie helfen dir, dich besser zu orientieren und schnell die gesuchten Informationen zu finden.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size:1em;color:hsl(0,0%,0%);\"><strong>Denk dran<\/strong>: Nicht alle Atlanten sind gleich aufgebaut. Das hei\u00dft, die Farben k\u00f6nnen sich bei verschiedenen Atlanten unterscheiden.<\/span><br><br>&nbsp;<\/p>"},"subContentId":"3396aa54-3524-464e-a909-0c186f8cf67c","metadata":{"contentType":"Text","license":"U","title":"Text unbenannt"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"solution":""},{"x":0,"y":0,"width":50.62358747896125,"height":99.99677234719216,"action":{"library":"H5P.Image 1.1","params":{"decorative":false,"contentName":"Bild","expandImage":"Bild vergr\u00f6\u00dfern","minimizeImage":"Bild verkleinern","alt":"Ein aufgeschlagener Atlas zeigt eine Weltkarte. Unter dem Buch ist die Farbpalette der Buchkapitel zu sehen.","file":{"path":"images\/file-689206a73c1d2.jpg","mime":"image\/jpeg","copyright":{"license":"U"},"width":1024,"height":1024}},"subContentId":"4e3435a6-042f-4c8d-866c-cfe7f9942bdc","metadata":{"contentType":"Image","license":"PD","title":"Farbkategorien Buchschnitt","authors":[{"name":"Digitalassistenz","role":"Author"}],"yearTo":2025,"licenseExtras":"erstellt mit der emuKI DALL\u00b7E 3"}},"alwaysDisplayComments":false,"backgroundOpacity":0,"displayAsButton":false,"buttonSize":"big","goToSlideType":"specified","invisible":false,"